   "type": "text",
   "text": "genuinely just curious if you keep getting attacked/found out/taken down why don't you make a password protected blog? surely that would be easier to keep away from main fandom? "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "eh I haven't technically been \"taken down\" in a longish time now. and a password protected blog is kinda silly to me since tumblr's one of the only places I use for \"discoverability\". twitter's a shithole and rule34 is finicky, and my website works but there's no way to get that out to people naturally. also, the more blogs I lose, the more blogs go into the blog jar. that's a win in my book"
  }
